This product uses the Attention Manifest Protocol (AMP) implementation
published as the `attention-manifest-protocol` npm package, version 0.9.0,
Copyright 2026 Eloy Kim, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The package provides the protocol surface, the executable kernel, the agent
gateway, the SQLite/entity persistence stack and the protocol types used by
this plugin. `src/host/amp.ts` binds the kernel and gateway to DeepSeek
Harness identity and lifetime; `src/host/handlers/` implements the host verbs;
`src/host/tools.ts` projects the seventeen agent modules onto `ctx.tools`.

AMP 0.7.1 depends on `semantic-typescript`, whose `Optional` module freezes
`Function.prototype` at import time. `src/host/freezeGuard.ts` refuses to
freeze shared built-in prototypes so DSH's own schemastery-based plugin
configs keep working, and every AMP import is dynamic so the guard runs first.
